        "Secondary Training Section Primary Quests Campaign Nightfall (Elonian only) Given by First Spear Dehvad in Kamadan, Jewel of Istan (Istan) Preceded by Honing your Skills Followed by Choose Your Secondary Profession Type Primary quest",
        "Looks like it's time for you to begin learning about secondary professions. Why don't you head back to the encampment near Chahbek Village and speak to a few of the experts there. They can tell you all about life in the professions."
