    {
      "heading": "Skills",
      "level": 4,
      "paragraphs": [
        "The following skills can be learned by a character and unlocked for the account by talking to each of the experts for the possible secondary professions. Accepting skills from the trainer for a different profession or accepting a different secondary profession during the next quest will unlearn these skills, but will leave them unlocked for the account:",
        "Note: Power Shot isn't taught by the next quest, make sure to learn it from Rakanja before starting the next quest as a secondary Ranger.",
        "Warrior Ranger Monk Necromancer Executioner's Strike \"For Great Justice!\" Mighty Blow Sever Artery Sprint \"Watch Yourself!\" Charm Animal Comfort Animal Flame Trap Kindle Arrows Power Shot Storm Chaser Banish Healing Touch Mend Ailment Remove Hex Resurrect Reversal of Fortune Animate Bone Minions Faintheartedness Life Siphon Plague Touch Strip Enchantment Well of Blood Mesmer Elementalist Paragon Dervish Backfire Conjure Phantasm Drain Enchantment Energy Tap Imagined Burden Shatter Hex Fire Storm Glyph of Elemental Power Ice Spear Lightning Strike Stone Daggers Ward Against Melee Anthem of Flame Barbed Spear Mending Refrain Signet of Aggression Signet of Synergy Wild Throw Chilling Victory Crippling Sweep Grenth's Fingers Heart of Holy Flame Imbue Health Whirling Charge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Dialogue",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Initial dialogue",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "First Spear Dehvad Good to see you again, <Character name>. Today must be my lucky day! I won 200 gold on a bet with First Spear Jahdugar and then you show up just when I need to talk to you. Looks like it's time for you to begin learning about secondary professions. Why don't you head back to the encampment near Chahbek Village and speak to a few of the experts there. They can tell you all about life in the professions.",
        "Accept: \"That sounds like good advice.\" Decline: \"I'm not yet ready to do that.\" Ask: \"Go speak to some of the experts at the encampment near Chahbek. Once you've explored some of your options, return to me and we can talk about a secondary profession.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reward dialogue",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "First Spear Dehvad I hope you got some sound advice and are able to choose the right profession to complement your combat style. Choosing a secondary profession is a big decision, but it isn't a permanent one. Once you've advanced in the ranks a bit you'll be able to change your secondary profession."
      ]
    }
