  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Secondary Training\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Primary Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n<p>(<a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elonian</a> only)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/First_Spear_Dehvad\" title=\"First Spear Dehvad\">First Spear Dehvad</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan\" title=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan\">Kamadan, Jewel of Istan</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Honing_your_Skills\" title=\"Honing your Skills\">Honing your Skills</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Followed by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Choose_Your_Secondary_Profession_(Nightfall_quest)\" title=\"Choose Your Secondary Profession (Nightfall quest)\">Choose Your Secondary Profession</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">Primary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Looks like it's time for you to begin learning about <a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_profession\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Secondary profession\">secondary professions</a>. Why don't you head back to the encampment near Chahbek Village and speak to a few of the experts there. They can tell you all about life in the professions.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skills</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elonian</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/Character\" title=\"Character\">character</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Travel to the <a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_encampment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sunspear encampment\">Sunspear encampment</a> near <a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village_(outpost)\" title=\"Chahbek Village (outpost)\">Chahbek Village</a>.</li>\n<li>Speak to at least one non-[primary profession] expert.</li>\n<li>See First Spear Devhad for your reward.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li>200 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Promotion_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sunspear Promotion Point\">Sunspear Promotion Points</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Commendation\" title=\"Battle Commendation\">Battle Commendation</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skills\">Skills</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Skills\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>The following skills can be learned by a character and <a href=\"/wiki/Unlock\" title=\"Unlock\">unlocked</a> for the account by talking to each of the experts for the possible secondary professions. Accepting skills from the trainer for a different profession or accepting a different secondary profession during the next quest will unlearn these skills, but will leave them unlocked for the account:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>Note:</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Shot\" title=\"Power Shot\">Power Shot</a> isn't taught by the next quest, make sure to learn it from <a href=\"/wiki/Rakanja\" title=\"Rakanja\">Rakanja</a> before starting the next quest as a secondary Ranger.</dd></dl>\n<table class=\"hidelist\" style=\"border: 1px solid silver; margin: 0.5em; text-align: left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"vertical-align: top; font-size: 110%;\">\n<th style=\"width: 20%; background: #FFFF88; border: 1px solid #EEAA33;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Warrior\" title=\"Warrior\">Warrior</a>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 20%; background: #CCFF99; border: 1px solid #55AA00;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 20%; background: #AACCFF; border: 1px solid #4444BB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 20%; background: #99CC99; border: 1px solid #336633;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancer\" title=\"Necromancer\">Necromancer</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n<td style=\"background: #FFFFCC; border: 1px solid #EEAA33;\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner%27s_Strike\" title=\"Executioner&#39;s Strike\"><img alt=\"Executioner&#39;s Strike\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d9/Executioner%27s_Strike.jpg/25px-Executioner%27s_Strike.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d9/Executioner%27s_Strike.jpg/38px-Executioner%27s_Strike.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d9/Executioner%27s_Strike.jpg/50px-Executioner%27s_Strike.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Executioner%27s_Strike\" title=\"Executioner&#39;s Strike\">Executioner's Strike</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22For_Great_Justice!%22\" title=\"&quot;For Great Justice!&quot;\"><img alt=\"&quot;For Great Justice!&quot;\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5f/%22For_Great_Justice%21%22.jpg/25px-%22For_Great_Justice%21%22.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5f/%22For_Great_Justice%21%22.jpg/38px-%22For_Great_Justice%21%22.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5f/%22For_Great_Justice%21%22.jpg/50px-%22For_Great_Justice%21%22.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/%22For_Great_Justice!%22\" title=\"&quot;For Great Justice!&quot;\">\"For Great Justice!\"</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mighty_Blow\" title=\"Mighty Blow\"><img alt=\"Mighty Blow\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Blow.jpg/25px-Mighty_Blow.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Blow.jpg/38px-Mighty_Blow.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Blow.jpg/50px-Mighty_Blow.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mighty_Blow\" title=\"Mighty Blow\">Mighty Blow</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sever_Artery\" title=\"Sever Artery\"><img alt=\"Sever Artery\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/54/Sever_Artery.jpg/25px-Sever_Artery.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/54/Sever_Artery.jpg/38px-Sever_Artery.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/54/Sever_Artery.jpg/50px-Sever_Artery.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sever_Artery\" title=\"Sever Artery\">Sever Artery</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sprint\" title=\"Sprint\"><img alt=\"Sprint\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/c5/Sprint.jpg/25px-Sprint.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c5/Sprint.jpg/38px-Sprint.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c5/Sprint.jpg/50px-Sprint.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sprint\" title=\"Sprint\">Sprint</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22Watch_Yourself!%22\" title=\"&quot;Watch Yourself!&quot;\"><img alt=\"&quot;Watch Yourself!&quot;\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg/25px-%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/ima