t=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a9/Signet_of_Aggression.jpg/38px-Signet_of_Aggression.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a9/Signet_of_Aggression.jpg/50px-Signet_of_Aggression.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Signet_of_Aggression\" title=\"Signet of Aggression\">Signet of Aggression</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Signet_of_Synergy\" title=\"Signet of Synergy\"><img alt=\"Signet of Synergy\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fe/Signet_of_Synergy.jpg/25px-Signet_of_Synergy.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fe/Signet_of_Synergy.jpg/38px-Signet_of_Synergy.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fe/Signet_of_Synergy.jpg/50px-Signet_of_Synergy.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Signet_of_Synergy\" title=\"Signet of Synergy\">Signet of Synergy</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Throw\" title=\"Wild Throw\"><img alt=\"Wild Throw\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/94/Wild_Throw.jpg/25px-Wild_Throw.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/94/Wild_Throw.jpg/38px-Wild_Throw.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/94/Wild_Throw.jpg/50px-Wild_Throw.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Throw\" title=\"Wild Throw\">Wild Throw</a></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background: #EEEEFF; border: 1px solid #7777CC;\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chilling_Victory\" title=\"Chilling Victory\"><img alt=\"Chilling Victory\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/32/Chilling_Victory.jpg/25px-Chilling_Victory.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/32/Chilling_Victory.jpg/38px-Chilling_Victory.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/32/Chilling_Victory.jpg/50px-Chilling_Victory.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Chilling_Victory\" title=\"Chilling Victory\">Chilling Victory</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crippling_Sweep\" title=\"Crippling Sweep\"><img alt=\"Crippling Sweep\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d0/Crippling_Sweep.jpg/25px-Crippling_Sweep.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d0/Crippling_Sweep.jpg/38px-Crippling_Sweep.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d0/Crippling_Sweep.jpg/50px-Crippling_Sweep.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Crippling_Sweep\" title=\"Crippling Sweep\">Crippling Sweep</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grenth%27s_Fingers\" title=\"Grenth&#39;s Fingers\"><img alt=\"Grenth&#39;s Fingers\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7e/Grenth%27s_Fingers.jpg/25px-Grenth%27s_Fingers.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7e/Grenth%27s_Fingers.jpg/38px-Grenth%27s_Fingers.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/7e/Grenth%27s_Fingers.jpg/50px-Grenth%27s_Fingers.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Grenth%27s_Fingers\" title=\"Grenth&#39;s Fingers\">Grenth's Fingers</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Holy_Flame\" title=\"Heart of Holy Flame\"><img alt=\"Heart of Holy Flame\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/1b/Heart_of_Holy_Flame.jpg/25px-Heart_of_Holy_Flame.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1b/Heart_of_Holy_Flame.jpg/38px-Heart_of_Holy_Flame.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1b/Heart_of_Holy_Flame.jpg/50px-Heart_of_Holy_Flame.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Holy_Flame\" title=\"Heart of Holy Flame\">Heart of Holy Flame</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Imbue_Health\" title=\"Imbue Health\"><img alt=\"Imbue Health\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/ad/Imbue_Health.jpg/25px-Imbue_Health.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/ad/Imbue_Health.jpg/38px-Imbue_Health.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/ad/Imbue_Health.jpg/50px-Imbue_Health.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Imbue_Health\" title=\"Imbue Health\">Imbue Health</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whirling_Charge\" title=\"Whirling Charge\"><img alt=\"Whirling Charge\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/63/Whirling_Charge.jpg/25px-Whirling_Charge.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/63/Whirling_Charge.jpg/38px-Whirling_Charge.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/63/Whirling_Charge.jpg/50px-Whirling_Charge.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Whirling_Charge\" title=\"Whirling Charge\">Whirling Charge</a></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>First Spear Dehvad</dt>\n<dd><i>Good to see you again, &lt;Character name&gt;. Today must be my lucky day! I won 200 gold on a bet with <a href=\"/wiki/First_Spear_Jahdugar\" title=\"First Spear Jahdugar\">First Spear Jahdugar</a> and then you show up just when I need to talk to you. Looks like it's time for you to begin learning about <b>secondary professions</b>. Why don't you head back to the <b>encampment</b> near Chahbek Village and speak to a few of the <b>experts</b> there. They can tell you all about life in the professions.</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"That sounds like good advice.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"I'm not yet ready to do that.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"Go speak to some of the <b>experts</b> at the <b>encampment</b> near Chahbek.  Once you've explored some of your options, return to me and we can talk about a <b>secondary profession</b>.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Secondary_Training&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>First Spear Dehvad</dt>\n<dd><i>I hope you got some sound advice and are able to choose the right profession to complement your combat style. Choosing a secondary profession is a big decision, but it isn't a permanent one. Once you've advanced in the ranks a bit you'll be able to change your secondary profession.</i></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008150723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.109 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.186 seco